      options: ["P₁V₁ = P₂V₂ (pressure and volume are inversely proportional)", "V₁/T₁ = V₂/T₂", "P₁/T₁ = P₂/T₂", "P₁V₁T₁ = P₂V₂T₂"], answer: "P₁V₁ = P₂V₂ (pressure and volume are inversely proportional)",
