      explanation: "In y = a sin(ωt + φ): y is elongation (m), a is amplitude (m), ω is angular frequency (rad/s), and φ is the initial phase (rad).", explanationKm: "ក្នុង y = a sin(ωt + φ)៖ y ជាអេឡុងកាស្យុង (m), a ជាអំព្លីទុត (m), ω ជាប៉ុលសាស្យុង (rad/s), និង φ ជាផាសដើម (rad)។",
