      options: ["It stays constant — energy oscillates between the capacitor and the inductor, but the total is conserved", "It steadily decreases to zero", "It doubles every cycle", "Only E_C matters; E_L stays zero"], answer: "It stays constant — energy oscillates between the capacitor and the inductor, but the total is conserved",
